        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86444, Modern Trinity Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Trinity Door Handle is great for contemporary spaces with its sleek design and modern finish color choices. This door pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. A thru-bolt mounted pull, it comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware and screw caps to keep the interior side of the door looking good. The Modern Trinity Door Pull will fit doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/trinity-back-to-back-handle-pair-emtek-btb-86444\"><b>Trinity Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Trinity Thru-Bolt Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86444-specifications.pdf?v=1704262360\"><b>Emtek Trinity Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86444:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86445:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
